%N A397086 Partial sums of A397085.
%C A397086 For n >= 1, a(n) = 0 exactly when n belongs to A133280, and a(n) = 1 exactly when n belongs to A195437. Hence A161886(n) is odd when a(n)=0 and even when a(n)=1.
%D A397086 Ian Connell, Elementary Problem E1382, Amer. Math. Monthly, 66 (1959), no. 8, 724.
%D A397086 Ian Connell and Andrew Korsak, Solution to Elementary Problem E1382, Amer. Math. Monthly, 67 (1960), no. 4, 380.
%D A397086 D. E. Iannucci and D. Mills-Taylor, On Generalizing the Connell Sequence, Journal of Integer Sequences, Vol. 2 (1999), Article 99.1.7.
%D A397086 R. Redheffer, Eine explizit lösbare Optimierungsaufgabe (in German), in Numerische Methoden bei Optimierungsaufgaben, Band 3 (Tagung, Math. Forschungsinst., Oberwolfach, 1976), pp. 213-216, Internat. Ser. Numer. Math., Vol. 36, Birkhäuser, Basel, 1977.
%D A397086 G. E. Stevens, A Connell-Like Sequence, Journal of Integer Sequences, Vol. 1 (1998), Article 98.1.4.
%H A397086 Anthony Hernandez, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.08962">The Redheffer Matrix Parity Problem</a>, arXiv:2607.08962 [math.CO], 2026.
%F A397086 a(n) = A053186(n) mod 2.
%F A397086 G.f.: (1 / (1 - x^2)) * Sum_{m>=1} x^(m^2+1) * (1 - x^(2*m)).
%e A397086 For n = 18: floor(sqrt(18))^2 = 16. a(18) = (1 - (-1)^(18 - 16)) / 2 = (1 - 1) / 2 = 0.
%o A397086 (PARI) a(n) = (n-sqrtint(n)^2) % 2; \\ _Michel Marcus_, Jul 21 2026
